Z||000012||avengador1||12-20-2001||09:37 AM||||Not only do I run the shop, I also am in charge of all the repairs and troubleshooting.I have a degree in Mechanical Engineering and Microprocessor Technology. I do about 98% of all repairs myself. If we have to call for outside help it cost us $60-$70 per hour plus travel time, meals, hotels, etc. By doing it myself I save the company thousands of dollars a year. I guess that is why I make the big bucks. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
