Z||000019||Ken Wittlief||12-20-2001||10:52 AM||||one of the secrets for handling money is to realize that when you work for 8 hours and your employer hands you a check<P> what you have really done is sold your life for money<BR> <BR> not all of it, only part of it, usually the BEST part of it - the part of the day when you are most alert and energenic<P> so you are trading your life for cash, hour by hour, day by day<P> and that handfull of dirty money that is in your hand at the end of the week - what is that?! that is your LIFE!<P> Keep this in mind when you spend it - that is your blood sweat and tears - and once a day is gone, its gone - you dont get it back.<P> Spend it wisely grasshopper :c)||||reg||10
